# API Integration

Before adding or changing website API calls, services, mappers, or dynamic content wiring:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/api-integration/SKILL.md`
2. Use `src/lib/api/` modules (`apiGet` / `apiGetOrNull` + module service/mapper)
3. Fetch in Server Components; pass props to client islands
4. Hide empty/unavailable sections — no blank UI, no invented API fields
5. Update the skill when introducing a new shared pattern

Do not add TanStack Query for marketing pages unless client refetch is required; prefer SSR fetch.
